This package bundles @kbn/ui-chrome-layout and @kbn/ui-side-navigation
and includes modified portions of elastic/kibana and elastic/vibe-kibana.
The bundled Kibana packages offer Elastic License 2.0, AGPL-3.0-only,
or SSPL-1.0. This distribution elects Elastic License 2.0.
The complete elected license is included in LICENSE and licenses/.

Modifications: standalone React props and types, static navigation snapshots,
English labels without Kibana i18n, UI-only agent/header integration,
and removal of the deprecated AI Assistant logo and its supported icon value.
The page-header replica adapts Kibana's declarative header/menu type contracts
and reuses matching EUI layout and button styling from vibe-kibana's PageHeader.
Original source paths and package versions are listed in SOURCES.md.
Original notices are retained in source and generated bundle legal comments.

KibanaTabs adapts the supported public types, tab interactions and selected-tab
corner SVG from Kibana's kbn-unified-tabs, via vibe-kibana's TabBar styling.
Modified by Elastic, November 2026: standalone EUI replica with no Kibana services.

KibanaHeader slot layout and KibanaProjectPicker adapt Kibana's project header
shell/right group and kbn-cps-utils cross-project picker button and styles.
Modified by Elastic, November 2026: standalone prop slots/counts replace services
and CPS context; afterUserMenu is a host-only prototype extension.

Internal HeaderActionButton and SearchButton adapt Kibana's shared chrome header
controls. Modified November 2026: callbacks and native key listeners replace
Kibana services; deprecated input props retain their one-release behavior.
